{0 Disassembler library}

This library implements the core functionality to disassemble PISA binaries to PASM programs.

The following modules are exposed:

- {{!Dis.Decode} Decode}: Decoding integer representation of PISA instructions and programs to their corresponding AST representations.

- {{!Dis.Errors} Errors}: Errors produced by the disassembler.

- {{!Dis.Utils} Utils}: Utility functions used by the disassembler.

